Sixteen parallel LED outputs on the ESP32-S3, which with the four RMT outputs makes twenty.

WLED 16.0.1 drives twelve digital outputs on the ESP32-S3: four through its RMT driver and
eight through the parallel driver, the LCD unit of the chip, which it uses in the
eight-lane form of the LED library NeoPixelBus. The LCD unit has sixteen data lines, and
the library has the sixteen-lane form of the same method. This patch switches WLED to it:

- wled00/const.h: for the ESP32-S3, WLED_MAX_I2S_CHANNELS is 16. WLED_MAX_DIGITAL_CHANNELS,
  the sum with the four RMT channels, so becomes 20, and WLED_MAX_BUSSES 28.
- wled00/bus_wrapper.h: for the ESP32-S3, the types of the parallel outputs are built on
  the library's X16 methods: the nine X1...Method names and the twelve B_32_IP_* types.
- wled00/FX_fcn.cpp: for the ESP32-S3, finalizeInit() counts the common buffer of the
  parallel driver as sixteen lanes of two bytes, twice what it counted.

Nothing changes for a chip other than the ESP32-S3.

The usermod cannot do this from outside: the limits are constants compiled into WLED, and
the type of the parallel outputs is chosen inside WLED's PolyBus. The chip has one LCD
unit, so outputs of the usermod's own could not exist beside WLED's parallel outputs
either.

diff --git a/wled00/FX_fcn.cpp b/wled00/FX_fcn.cpp
index 31c23f8..5e6cb3c 100644
--- a/wled00/FX_fcn.cpp
+++ b/wled00/FX_fcn.cpp
@@ -1257,7 +1257,11 @@ void WS2812FX::finalizeInit() {
       constexpr unsigned stepFactor = 3; // 3 step cadence (3 bits per pixel bit)
       #endif
       unsigned i2sCommonMem = (stepFactor * bus.count * (3*Bus::hasRGB(bus.type)+Bus::hasWhite(bus.type)+Bus::hasCCT(bus.type)) * (Bus::is16bit(bus.type)+1));
+      #if defined(CONFIG_IDF_TARGET_ESP32S3)
+      if (useParallelI2S) i2sCommonMem *= 16; // parallel LCD uses 16 lanes of two bytes, requiring 16x the DMA buffer size (common buffer shared between all parallel busses)
+      #else
       if (useParallelI2S) i2sCommonMem *= 8; // parallel I2S uses 8 channels, requiring 8x the DMA buffer size (common buffer shared between all parallel busses)
+      #endif
       if (i2sCommonMem > I2SdmaMem) I2SdmaMem = i2sCommonMem;
     }
     #endif
